flowchart TD
    CLI[CLI: scan / scan-history] --> Orch[Scan Orchestrator]
    API[API: POST /api/v1/scans] --> Orch
    FE[Frontend: Scans page] --> API

    Orch --> Create[create_scan_run]
    Create --> DB[(scan_runs table)]

    Orch --> Filter[get_cards_for_scan]
    Filter --> SF{ScanFilter}
    SF -->|set_code, format, rarity| UC[(user_collection)]
    SF -->|card_ids| UC

    Orch --> Provider[MypCardsProvider]
    Provider --> MYP[MYP Cards]
    Provider --> Parser[parse_jsonld_price]

    Orch --> Store[insert_price_observations]
    Store --> OBS[(price_observations)]

    Orch --> Update[update_scan_run]
    Update --> DB

    API2[GET /api/v1/scans] --> Repo[list_scan_runs]
    API3[GET /api/v1/scans/id] --> Repo
    Repo --> DB
    CLI2[CLI: scan-history] --> Repo
